 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "上线不是终点。",
   "spoken": "上线不是终点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.184,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "合约上线以后，要有人一直盯着。",
   "spoken": "合约上线以后，要有人一直盯着。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.004,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 4.102,
   "speechEnd": 6.447
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "同时开一个漏洞赏金，让发现问题的白帽，有动力先来报告。",
   "spoken": "同时开一个漏洞赏金，让发现问题的白帽，有动力先来报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.488,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 7.586,
   "speechEnd": 11.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "盯什么？锁仓总量突然下跌，比如 10 分钟内跌了超过 10%。",
   "spoken": "盯什么？锁仓总量突然下跌，比如 10 分钟内跌了超过 10%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.916,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 13.014,
   "speechEnd": 18.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "同一笔交易里，出现大额闪电贷和本协议的调用。",
   "spoken": "同一笔交易里，出现大额闪电贷和本协议的掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.232,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 19.33,
   "speechEnd": 23.199
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "任何管理员函数被调用，实现地址变了，时间锁队列里多了新操作。",
   "spoken": "任何管理员函数被掉用，实现地址变了，时间锁队列里多了新操作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.252,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 24.35,
   "speechEnd": 29.79
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "预言机价格偏离其他来源，或者超过心跳时间没有更新。",
   "spoken": "预言机价格偏离其他来源，或者超过心跳时间没有更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.832,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 30.93,
   "speechEnd": 35.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "跨链两侧，锁定量和铸造量对不上。",
   "spoken": "跨链两侧，锁定量和铸造量对不上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.428,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 36.526,
   "speechEnd": 39.407
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "告警响起，接下来是应急流程。",
   "spoken": "告警响起，接下来是应急流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.44,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 40.538,
   "speechEnd": 43.121
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "值班人员先确认异常。",
   "spoken": "值班人员先确认异常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.188,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 44.286,
   "speechEnd": 45.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "确认后触发暂停，守护者的暂停权限没有延迟。",
   "spoken": "确认后触发暂停，守护者的暂停权限没有延迟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.048,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 47.146,
   "speechEnd": 51.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "然后组建作战室，里面有开发和审计方，还有安全响应团队，比如 SEAL 911 这类社区应急组织。",
   "spoken": "然后组建作战室，里面有开发和审计方，还有安全响应团队，比如 SEAL 911 这类社区应急组织。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.524,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 52.622,
   "speechEnd": 60.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "评估能不能白帽救援，抢先把剩余资金转到安全的地方。",
   "spoken": "评估能不能白帽救援，抢先把剩余资金转到安全的地方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 61.624,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 61.722,
   "speechEnd": 66.043
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "联系交易所和稳定币发行方，冻结被盗资金。",
   "spoken": "联系交易所和稳定币发形方，冻结被盗资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 67.1,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 67.198,
   "speechEnd": 70.733
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "最后发布公告和复盘。",
   "spoken": "最后发布公告和复盘。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.784,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 71.882,
   "speechEnd": 73.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "看一个例子。",
   "spoken": "看一个例子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
